{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30604","headline":"和主司王起 · 黄颇","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十二年文敎主，三千上士满皇州。\n独陪宣父蓬瀛奏，方接颜生鲁卫游。\n多羡龙门齐变化，屡看鸡树第名流。\n升堂何处最荣美，朱紫环[尊]几处酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄颇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}